{"id":"npc:%E5%B0%A4%E5%A1%94%26%E5%B0%A4%E5%90%89%E5%85%84%E5%BC%9F","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"森蚺部族的阿达克利斯人，兄长尤塔因深入矿区而染上矿石病造成心力衰竭，祭典结束后突然发病，得到嘉维尔的救治。弟弟尤吉因没有解释清哥哥染病的具体过程而导致嘉维尔误会了森蚺。如今还在阿卡胡拉地区生活并策划建造“尤吉尤塔塔”。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情RI-ST-1 悍将之心。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_npc_071.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/f/ff/Avg_avg_npc_071.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_071.png"}],"appearances":[]}